title: The host closes the app with a guest connected and text of the guest not saved: the host is asked, the guest is told, and joining again fails cleanly
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\nline 02\nline 03\nline 04\n
guest-expect-log: opening .*shared.*share-text

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 10000
quit
wait 1200
mark host-asked
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1500
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
edit notes.txt 3 1
key end
type typed-by-beto.
wait 8000
mark after-the-host-quit
wait 800
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
mark joining-a-closed-session
wait 1500
quit
wait 1500
